/*
  RecentChargesSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0296 · RecentChargesSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `RecentChargesSection` resolves (table "RecentChargesSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/RecentChargesSection.tsx — the title, the five
  DataTable column headers, the "View all" link, and the empty message), reusing the web
  `common.*` namespace verbatim. The second group backs the native chrome (the P4 leaf
  freshness / loading / error copy) so the Swift sources hold no English prose literals. The
  energy unit "kWh", the SOC "%", the "→" arrow, the duration "h"/"m" suffixes and the currency
  symbol are device/data literals carried in code (matching the web, which hardcodes them), not
  translated strings.
*/

